  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EDM Short-Term Investment Project: Design and Implementation Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Short Term Investment Programme supports the upgarde of transmission infrastructure in Mozambique to alleciate suppply contrants and improve secrurity and quality of electricity supply. The programme is supported together with KFW and EIB. This particular programme povides support to tender package, tender assistance and construction supervision.</narrative>
  </description>
